      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785763068036,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Use case\n- 3rd party vendor (aur kuch implement karna ho tab)\n- ek lagacy code hai(very old code) aur ek new code hai to un dono k syntax or methods me bahut changes ho gaye hai aur hume un dono ko baat karwani hai to hum udhar adapter use kar skte hai",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Use case\n- 3rd party vendor (aur kuch implement karna ho tab)\n- ek lagacy code hai(very old code) aur ek new code hai to un dono k syntax or methods me bahut changes ho gaye hai aur hume un dono ko baat karwani hai to hum udhar adapter use kar skte hai",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "pFoyZ2zSOkj6FvMV44sZs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 162.50406570187957,
      "y": 2149.7213953502715,
      "width": 645.960613396691,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cK6j",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 631375307,
      "version": 384,
      "versionNonce": 1006240371,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785763068036,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Adapter converts the interface of a class into another interface\nthat client expects. Adapter lets classes work together that\ncould 'nt, Otherwise because of incompatible interface.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Adapter converts the interface of a class into another interface that client expects. Adapter lets classes work together that could 'nt, Otherwise because of incompatible interface.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
